# lib/client.js is a COMMITTED build artifact and CI diffs it against a fresh
# build to catch a stale one (F7). On a Windows runner core.autocrlf would check
# it out as CRLF while tsdown writes LF, so that diff would fail for a reason
# that has nothing to do with the code. Pin the whole repo to LF instead of
# special-casing the check.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.tgz binary
